---
title: Contact Taskip Support and Get Help
sidebar:
  order: 6
---
Learn how to reach our HoneyBook Support team by chat or email, or use our 24/7 support bot for quick answers anytime.

Whether you have a question, need troubleshooting help, or want guidance using Taskip features, our Support team is here to help. You can connect directly through a session, support ticket, email, or our 24/7 Support Bot for fast answers, so you can get back to managing your projects.

## **Book a Free Session**

Schedule a personalized 30-minute session with our Support team:

1. Log in to your **Taskip account.**
1. Navigate to the **Dashboard** and click **Book a Free Session**.

![](./contact-support-and-get-help/content/image-26-1024x461.png)

**3. Select your preferred time and schedule your 30-minute session with the team.**

![](./contact-support-and-get-help/content/image-27.png)

## **Support Ticket**

Submit issues or requests through [Taskip’s Support Ticket system](https://taskip.net/support-ticket/):

1. Go to the **Menu** and select **Ticket**.
1. Click **Add New Ticket.**

![](./contact-support-and-get-help/content/image-28-1024x422.png)

3. Fill in the **ticket name** and other details about your issue.

1. Set the **priority level** of your ticket.

1. Attach any relevant files, if applicable.

![](./contact-support-and-get-help/content/image-29-1.png)

6. Submit the ticket.

1. You’ll receive a confirmation and can track updates until your issue is resolved.

## **Taskip Contact Us Page**

You can also reach the Taskip team through the **Contact Us** page.

1. Go to the [Taskip Contact Us](https://taskip.net/contact/) page.
1. Fill out the **contact form**.
1. Enter your **email address.**
1. Write your **message or inquiry**.
1. Submit the form.

Our team will review your message and respond to your email as soon as possible.

![](./contact-support-and-get-help/content/image-30-1024x529.png)

## **Priority Support Via Discord**

Taskip also offers **Priority Support through Discord** for faster assistance and direct communication with the team.

1. Join the **Taskip Discord community** using the invite link.
1. Navigate to the **support** or **priority support channel**.
1. Share your question or issue with relevant details.
1. The Taskip team will review your request and respond as quickly as possible.
